{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>ואשחקם</b> — <b>אריקם</b> (I will crush them), like <b>ורקות בשר</b>, even though it should have had the qoph as dagesh."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The verse cited appears to be from Micah 3:2–3 (ורקות בשר); 'the qoph as dagesh' refers to expected doubling after the prefix, but the text here is textually difficult and rendered hyper-literally."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:27:44.828209822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}